  "_howTo": [
    "HOW TO GIVE SOMEONE A BADGE:",
    "1. Find an empty slot below (userId is \"\").",
    "2. Paste their Discord user ID into userId (right-click them > Copy User ID; turn on Developer Mode in Discord settings if you don't see it).",
    "3. username and displayName are optional labels just for you. LumenCord ignores them.",
    "4. Put badge IDs in the badges list, e.g. [\"helper\", \"lemon\"]. One person can have many badges. The full list is in _reference at the bottom.",
    "5. Save, then run push-to-github.bat. Everyone sees the change within about 30 minutes.",
    "Empty slots (userId \"\") are ignored, so leave as many as you like.",
    "Member stages and game stages are automatic. Don't add them here."
